    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<i>Fastival</i> is an arcade racing game where players speed through different attractions within a vibrant and cartoony carnival throughout each race. Knock down targets as you race to trigger unique effects on the track that you can use to your advantage. Collect wacky items that can be used to mess with other racers to enhance your driving capabilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830700/extras/1922e09528a55e40cac8d7ad16e2200f.avif?t=1718385041\" width=614 height=280 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race Through Three Unique Tracks</h2>Each track is a different section of the <i>Fastival </i>with its own fun theme. Enter the Fastival in \u201cWhirling Welcome,\u201d navigating tight turns and spiraling around a merry go round. Navigate a field of giant wack-a-moles popping up and down and zoom across a roller coaster. Fly through a ring of fire and get launched by a cannon up into the big top circus tent.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830700/extras/508dd695c3e3700428c6b2eddd9e837f.avif?t=1718385041\" width=614 height=114 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Each Bumper Car</h2><i>Fastival</i> features four different types of bumper cars that players can choose from each with unique driving strengths and weaknesses. The Shark car boasts a higher top speed but is more challenging to control while the Vintage car is slower to accelerate but heavier, allowing you to utilize drifting to your advantage more often.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830700/extras/035080d278aeec33557de2c72a45d9d6.avif?t=1718385041\" width=614 height=188 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Knock Down Targets to Affect the Race</h2>In <i>Fastival</i>, you can gain an advantage as you race through unique interactions with the environment. Knock down targets in each race by driving through them to trigger a temporary effect on the race track. Some targets will reveal a shorter path while others activate hazards that other racers have to steer clear of.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Items to Take Out the Competition</h2>As you race, collect carnival tickets that turn into one of five fun items. Activate a firecracker to launch yourself forward and gain temporary invincibility, or throw a volley of water balloons at other racers to spin out their vehicles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830700/extras/28d4339b632cd03132bf35e981926c56.avif?t=1718385041\" width=614 height=122 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Racer</h2>Mix and match between four cute costumes and color palettes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Notes</h2><i>Fastival</i> was created by the students of Cohort 33 at SMU Guildhall, a graduate video game design program in Dallas, Texas.  In their second Team Game Project course (&quot;TGP2&quot;), the entire cohort of 47 students from all disciplines\u2014Art Creation, Programming, Design, and Production\u2014with help from three game music students in SMU's Meadows School of the Arts came together each day to make this game.  For many students, this is their first experience working on a large team, and the course is designed to teach the students how to communicate at scale and iterate on the game design to find the fun.  To accomplish this in roughly 12 weeks of production and produce such a vibrant, fun game is a challenge, and we are really proud to share their hard work with you.<br><br>Thank you for playing.  We hope you enjoy <i>Fastival</i>. If you do, please consider leaving a kind note in the community hub and share the game with your friends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830700/extras/9e9bdc00bee8c71cf950051272168679.avif?t=1718385041\" width=614 height=282 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<i>Fastival</i> is an arcade racing game where players speed through different attractions within a vibrant and cartoony carnival throughout each race. Knock down targets as you race to trigger unique effects on the track that you can use to your advantage. Collect wacky items that can be used to mess with other racers to enhance your driving capabilities.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830700/extras/1922e09528a55e40cac8d7ad16e2200f.avif?t=1718385041\" width=614 height=280 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Race Through Three Unique Tracks</h2>Each track is a different section of the <i>Fastival </i>with its own fun theme. Enter the Fastival in \u201cWhirling Welcome,\u201d navigating tight turns and spiraling around a merry go round. Navigate a field of giant wack-a-moles popping up and down and zoom across a roller coaster. Fly through a ring of fire and get launched by a cannon up into the big top circus tent.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830700/extras/508dd695c3e3700428c6b2eddd9e837f.avif?t=1718385041\" width=614 height=114 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Each Bumper Car</h2><i>Fastival</i> features four different types of bumper cars that players can choose from each with unique driving strengths and weaknesses. The Shark car boasts a higher top speed but is more challenging to control while the Vintage car is slower to accelerate but heavier, allowing you to utilize drifting to your advantage more often.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830700/extras/035080d278aeec33557de2c72a45d9d6.avif?t=1718385041\" width=614 height=188 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Knock Down Targets to Affect the Race</h2>In <i>Fastival</i>, you can gain an advantage as you race through unique interactions with the environment. Knock down targets in each race by driving through them to trigger a temporary effect on the race track. Some targets will reveal a shorter path while others activate hazards that other racers have to steer clear of.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Items to Take Out the Competition</h2>As you race, collect carnival tickets that turn into one of five fun items. Activate a firecracker to launch yourself forward and gain temporary invincibility, or throw a volley of water balloons at other racers to spin out their vehicles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830700/extras/28d4339b632cd03132bf35e981926c56.avif?t=1718385041\" width=614 height=122 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Your Racer</h2>Mix and match between four cute costumes and color palettes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Developer Notes</h2><i>Fastival</i> was created by the students of Cohort 33 at SMU Guildhall, a graduate video game design program in Dallas, Texas.  In their second Team Game Project course (&quot;TGP2&quot;), the entire cohort of 47 students from all disciplines\u2014Art Creation, Programming, Design, and Production\u2014with help from three game music students in SMU's Meadows School of the Arts came together each day to make this game.  For many students, this is their first experience working on a large team, and the course is designed to teach the students how to communicate at scale and iterate on the game design to find the fun.  To accomplish this in roughly 12 weeks of production and produce such a vibrant, fun game is a challenge, and we are really proud to share their hard work with you.<br><br>Thank you for playing.  We hope you enjoy <i>Fastival</i>. If you do, please consider leaving a kind note in the community hub and share the game with your friends.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2830700/extras/9e9bdc00bee8c71cf950051272168679.avif?t=1718385041\" width=614 height=282 /></span>",
    "short_description": "Race through an enchanting carnival and be on the lookout for wacky obstacles and cool shortcuts as you compete against up to three other friends in this cute and cartoony arcade racing game!",
